{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-ocean-point","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"oceanpoint","about":"Introducing Emaar Ocean Point, your gateway to coastal luxury at Mina Rashid. Nestled within the prestigious Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina, Emaar Ocean Point offers an unparalleled living experience that seamlessly blends modern comfort with timeless elegance. Discover a curated selection of exquisite 1 to 3 bedroom apartments and luxurious 3 bedroom townhouses, meticulously crafted to provide residents with a serene retreat amidst the bustling city. At Emaar Ocean Point, residents are treated to breathtaking views that span from lush landscapes to the iconic skyline of Dubai Downtown. Whether it's the verdant surroundings, the vibrant pool area, or the majestic cityscape, every aspect of Ocean Point is designed to evoke a sense of wonder and awe.As an Ocean Point resident, you'll enjoy unparalleled access to some of Dubai's most iconic landmarks and attractions, including Port Rashid and the bustling Central Canal Pool and promenade. With its prime location and luxurious amenities, Ocean Point offers the perfect blend of urban convenience and natural beauty. Experience the epitome of coastal living at Emaar Ocean Point Mina Rashid. Elevate your lifestyle and discover a new level of luxury living at Ocean Point.","price":1600000,"title":"Ocean Point","bitrix":{"id":374,"pf_id":"are.2.13600","source":null,"project_id":"Ocean Point","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Ocean Point","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Mina Rashid"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/oceanpoint_feat_80173a3094.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/oceanpoint_feat_80173a3094.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2548579,"lng":55.2756623},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https: